                      "title": "3.3. Pohon Proyeksi Acak (Random Projection Trees) dan Pustaka Annoy (Spotify)",
                      "orderIndex": 3,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Pohon Proyeksi Acak (Random Projection Trees) dan Pustaka Annoy (Spotify): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
