                      "orderIndex": 1,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Arsitektur Internal Vector Database: Storage Engine (LSM-Tree, In-Memory Graph, dan Mmap): formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
