                      "title": "11.2. Strategi Pemotongan Teks (Chunking): Fixed-Size, Recursive, dan Semantic Chunking",
                      "orderIndex": 2,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Strategi Pemotongan Teks (Chunking): Fixed-Size, Recursive, dan Semantic Chunking: formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
