                      "title": "13.4. Arsitektur Query Routing & Scatter-Gather: Agregasi Hasil Top-k Lintas Shard",
                      "orderIndex": 4,
                      "description": "Eksplorasi mendalam Arsitektur Query Routing & Scatter-Gather: Agregasi Hasil Top-k Lintas Shard: formulasi matematis, kode runnable mandiri, analisis kesalahan umum, dan studi kasus industri.",
